Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:01.17,text sub,,0,0,0,,你就是勇者吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:19.43,text sub,,0,0,0,,魔王大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:28.69,text sub,,0,0,0,,人类 现在就暂且将安特·伊苏拉让给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:34.82,text sub,,0,0,0,,但我定会回来将你们和安特·伊苏拉一并收入囊中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:40.20,text sub,,0,0,0,,别想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:57.53,text sub,,0,0,0,,你到底是哪里做错了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:41.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正兰亭粗黑_GBK\fad(61,851)\fs60\frz247.4\bord1\pos(1467.6,670.8)\3c&H000000&\3a&H3F&}{\alphaFF\t(0,50,1,\alpha0}魔{\alphaFF\t(148,198,1,\alpha0}王{\alphaFF\t(297,347,1,\alpha0}\N\h{\alphaFF\t(445,495,1,\alpha0}在{\c&HF753DF&}{\alphaFF\t(594,644,1,\alpha0}笹{\alphaFF\t(742,792,1,\alpha0}塚{\c\alphaFF\t(890,940,1,\alpha0}大{\alphaFF\t(1039,1089,1,\alpha0}喊
